    - Full ShaderBuildTool.Tests: Debug 108/108 and Release 108/108, no failures.
      Commands: dotnet test ShaderBuildTool.Tests/ShaderBuildTool.Tests.csproj (default Debug; -c Release for Release)
      --no-restore -p:UseSharedCompilation=false -nr:false -m:1 --tl:off -v:minimal.
      Complete standard process environment resolved the prior runtimeconfig generation issue;
